 rts & Closings
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + In preparation for the launch of Maine eCourts and eFiling in Region 
 2 courts\, the Bridgton District Court will be closed all day to the publi
 c beginning Monday\, September 14th through Friday\, September 25th. Monda
 y\, September 28th through Friday\, October 2nd\, the court will be closed
  in the mornings\, from 8am to noon.\nRemoved:\n  - Thursday\, September 1
 0\, 2026\, the Bridgton District Court will be closed all day to the publi
 c. The Clerk's Office will be available by phone during normal business ho
 urs.\n  - In preparation for the launch of Maine eCourts and eFiling in Re
 gion 2 courts\, the Bridgton District Court will be closed all day to the 
 public beginning Tuesday\, September 15th through Friday\, September 25th.
  Monday\, September 28th through Friday\, October 2nd\, the court will be 
 closed in the mornings\, from 8am to noon.\nhttps://www.courts.maine.gov/c
 ourts/alerts.shtml
