  call 564-2240.\n  + If there is inclement weather\, please go to www.cour
 ts.maine.gov for updates.\n  + PROHIBITION OF ELECTRONIC DEVICES: Please b
 e advised that pursuant to Administrative Order JB-20-01\, use of electron
 ic devices during trial or while in deliberations are prohibited and all d
 evices will need to be temporarily surrendered. During jury selection\, al
 l devices must be turned off.\n  + September 11\, 0000\n  + The following 
 September Traverse Jurors are to report to the York Judicial Center in Bid
 deford on Monday\, September 14th at 10am\n  + 1\, 4\, 6\, 7\, 9\, 10\, 11
 \, 12\, 15\, 17\, 18\, 21\, 23\, 26\, 27\, 30\, 31\, 32\, 36\, 37\, 38\, 4
